---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="What’s new">
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">NOTES FROM THE STUDIO</p>
    <h1>What’s new at Ahab</h1>
    <p style="margin-bottom:40px">
      A running note of the things we’re building and improving.
    </p>
    <section class="update-entry">
      <span class="pill">FIRST RELEASE</span>
      <h2>A place for your first take</h2>
      <p>
        Ahab starts with two ways to create: personal presenter videos and short
        scenes guided by your references. One-time packages, your own script,
        optional uploaded narration, and a private library.
      </p>
      <p>
        Availability of generation and payments is shown inside your account.
        There are no sample customer results or performance promises here—your
        work starts in your studio.
      </p>
      <a
        class="text-link"
        href="/about"
        style="display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;font-size:13px"
      >
        Learn how Ahab works
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
